"log.title": "Event log",
"lore.arcade": "Neon spotlights, a microphone and a stage that never sleeps: a K-pop idol keeps the show going until the last round.",
"lore.evangelion": "A quiet pilot in a plug suit, a mysterious giant and a countdown that never stops. Purple, acid green and warning orange: sync rate rising.",
"lore.hanabi": "A paper lantern and a sky full of fireworks: one burst for every win.",
"lore.hoshi": "A star-gazing girl who keeps one constellation for every team that finishes a race.",
"lore.killlakill": "A drifter with a giant scissor blade takes on a school ruled by living uniforms. Loud, red, black and unstoppable: slash through the leaderboard.",
"lore.kintsugi": "A modern black vase mended with gold: the cracks are what make it special.",
"lore.latvija": "The Latvian flag: carmine red with a thin white stripe, one of the oldest flags in the world, first mentioned in the 13th century.",
"lore.mezs": "Rainis (1865-1929), the great Latvian poet and playwright. His verses about freedom and the forest of the soul still echo in every Latvian school.",
"lore.okeans": "A friendly whale gliding through the Baltic night: deep water, quiet light and one slow wave at a time.",
"lore.onimai": "Hearts everywhere, sparkles in the air and a very excited little helper: everything is cuter now, and the love never stops!",
"lore.sakura": "Cherry blossoms in full bloom: the little rice-cake mascot follows you through every race.",
"lore.saulriets": "A small sailboat crossing a glowing sunset: the day is almost over, the best light is still ahead.",
"lore.sora": "A soft cloud in a wide blue sky: calm before the first train leaves.",
"lore.toradora": "A tiny girl with a fierce temper and a soft heart, who teams up with an unlucky-looking classmate. Orange like a tiger, sweet like her secret side.",
"lore.zerotwo": "A pink-haired pilot with red horns from a world of giant robots, always searching for her one true partner. This theme turns every team into a pair that rides together.",
